@FunEvents.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5053
@ApiKey = <set-a-local-user-secret>
@IdempotencyKey = 5bf7893b-aeab-4f32-8b38-89373a4812e1

### Create a reservation
POST {{FunEvents.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{IdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "eventCode": "EVT-001",
  "sessionCode": "SES-001-A",
  "userCode": "USR-042",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Health check
GET {{FunEvents.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
